           05  SORT-CORP-CODE            PIC X(8).
           05  SORT-QUANTITY             PIC 9(8).
           05  SORT-UM                   PIC X(2).
      *----------- SORT-UNIT-COST WILL ALSO BE TOTAL COST FOR THE
      *----------- INVOICE COST OPTION OF THE REPORT.
           05  SORT-UNIT-COST            PIC S9(12)V9(4).
           05  SORT-EXP-CAT              PIC X(1).
           05  SORT-WO                   PIC X(10).
           05  SORT-BUDGET-NO            PIC X(12).
           05  SORT-ORIG                 PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-REL-DATE-CN.
               10  SORT-REL-DATE-CC      PIC X(2).
               10  SORT-REL-DATE         PIC X(6).
           05  SORT-EQUIP-NUM            PIC X(6).

